WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.230
A man in the wilderness wears
camel's hair and a leather belt.

2
00:00:04.280 --> 00:00:07.080
He eats locusts and wild honey.

3
00:00:07.130 --> 00:00:11.350
Crowds pour out to the River
Jordan, confessing their sins.

4
00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:16.420
His message is a baptism of
repentance, for forgiveness of sins.

5
00:00:16.470 --> 00:00:19.510
Then Jesus arrives to be baptised too.

6
00:00:19.560 --> 00:00:21.770
Christians believe he was sinless.

7
00:00:21.820 --> 00:00:25.110
So why would he be
baptised for forgiveness?

8
00:00:25.160 --> 00:00:30.050
In this mission, you'll read what John
says about someone mightier than himself.

9
00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:33.760
Then you'll follow Jesus into
the wilderness for 40 days,

10
00:00:33.810 --> 00:00:37.120
and see why many
Christians still keep Lent.

11
00:00:37.170 --> 00:00:42.760
Your mission: find out why Jesus, whom
Christians call sinless, was baptised.
